ng an audit table#Delete a dataset#Procedure#{7}":[141,142],"#Managing an audit table#Delete a dataset#Procedure#{8}":[143,146],"#Managing an audit table#Related":[147,152],"#Managing an audit table#Related#{1}":[149,149],"#Managing an audit table#Related#{2}":[150,150],"#Managing an audit table#Related#{3}":[151,152]},"outlinks":[{"title":"create a project","target":"create-project","line":24},{"title":"Working with external datasets","target":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ServiceNow/ServiceNowDocs/australia/markdown/now-intelligence/process-mining/external-dataset.md","line":26},{"title":"Process Mining Workspace","target":"analyst-workbench-overview","line":38},{"title":"Import data into the audit table","target":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ServiceNow/ServiceNowDocs/australia/markdown/now-intelligence/process-mining/import-data.md","line":85},{"title":"Import data into the audit table","target":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ServiceNow/ServiceNowDocs/australia/markdown/now-intelligence/process-mining/import-data.md","line":114},{"title":"Process Mining","target":"process-mining","line":143},{"title":"Create a project","target":"create-project","line":149},{"title":"Process Mining workspace","target":"analyst-workbench-overview","line":150},{"title":"Process Mining","target":"process-mining","line":151}],"metadata":{"title":"Managing an audit table","description":"After the audit and record tables are created with the imported data, you can use them to create a project. You can also share, edit, empty, or delete the tables.Share the audit and record tables with the analyst to analyze the data. The audit and record tables are available only to the administrator. However, the administrator might want an analyst to look at the tables and create projects.Edit a dataset if you want to change the dataset, such as add or delete data from the current dataset.Empty a dataset when you want to remove the old data and import new data from the same external system to the same table.Delete a dataset when the dataset is no longer needed. Your analysis is complete, and you want to delete the entire tables.","locale":"en-US","canonical_url":"https://www.servicenow.com/docs/r/now-intelligence/process-mining/managing-audit-table.html","release":"australia","product":"Process Mining","classification":"process-mining","topic_type":"concept","last_updated":"2026-03-12","reading_time_minutes":3,"breadcrumb":["Working with external datasets","Use","Process Mining","Platform Analytics"],"tags":["#now-intelligence","#process-mining","#workflow","#bottlenecks","#analytics","#type-concept"]},"task_lines":[],"tasks":{},"codeblock_ranges":[]},"smart_blocks:ServiceNowOfficialDocs/now-intelligence/process-mining/managing-audit-table.md#---frontmatter---": {"path":null,"last_embed":{"hash":null},"embeddings":{},"text":null,"length":0,"last_read":{"hash":"127q4tv","at":1784561345823},"key":"ServiceNowOfficialDocs/now-intelligence/process-mining/managing-audit-table.md#---frontmatter---","lines":[1,20],"size":1250,"outlinks":[],"class_name":"SmartBlock"},
